PS-010 — Add operational controls and monitoring

Required controls

- Backend request and error metrics.
- Rate-limit and abuse monitoring.
- Gemini usage and cost monitoring.
- Crash reporting with Firebase Crashlytics or an equivalent service.
- Network failure metrics.
- Privacy-safe request correlation IDs.
